1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,380
Bend just your thumb

2
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:01,889
all the way

3
00:00:01,889 --> 00:00:03,050
across your palm.

4
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,007
Did your pointer finger

5
00:00:04,007 --> 00:00:04,800
move?

6
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:05,690
Moved?

7
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:06,533
Your thumb's got

8
00:00:06,533 --> 00:00:07,541
a clingy little

9
00:00:07,541 --> 00:00:08,800
SIDEKICK.

10
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,350
Bend it again...

11
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:11,596
see those strings?

12
00:00:11,596 --> 00:00:12,590
A tiny strap

13
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:13,800
ties them together.

14
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:15,120
Thumb pulls...

15
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,633
pointer follows.

16
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:17,490
No strap?

17
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:19,300
Your thumb goes solo.

18
00:00:19,334 --> 00:00:20,410
Gorillas?

19
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:21,247
Their thumb's string

20
00:00:21,247 --> 00:00:22,077
is just a branch

21
00:00:22,077 --> 00:00:23,664
of the pointer's.

22
00:00:23,794 --> 00:00:25,270
So that strap?

23
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:27,574
Maybe a little leftover...

24
00:00:27,574 --> 00:00:28,467
ape.

25
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:30,581
Now try your OTHER hand.

26
00:00:30,581 --> 00:00:33,160
It might be less ape.

